# Licence index — Tesserafin Server @VERSION@ (@RID@)

This archive contains **three separately licensed works**. They are listed
separately because they are separate: bundling a GPL-3.0-or-later media runtime
alongside a GPL-2.0-or-later server does not relicense the server, and stating
one licence for the whole archive would misdescribe both.

| Component | Paths | Licence | Text |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Tesserafin server | `lib/tesserafin/` (excluding `ffmpeg/`), `bin/tesserafin` | GPL-2.0-or-later | `LICENSE` |
| Tesserafin FFmpeg runtime | `lib/tesserafin/ffmpeg/`, `share/tesserafin/ffmpeg/` | GPL-3.0-or-later | `licenses/ffmpeg/` |
| Tesserafin Web client | `share/tesserafin/web/` | GPL-2.0-or-later plus its recorded dependency licences | `share/tesserafin/web-licenses/` |

## The server — GPL-2.0-or-later

Built from `https://github.com/tesserafin-project/tesserafin.git` at commit
`@VCS_REF@`. The complete text is in `LICENSE` at the root of this archive.

## The FFmpeg runtime — GPL-3.0-or-later

Build revision `@F0_BUILD_REVISION@`, built from source at
`@F0_UPSTREAM_REPOSITORY@` commit `@F0_UPSTREAM_COMMIT@`.

FFmpeg is configured with `--enable-gpl` and `--enable-version3`, which makes the
runtime **as a whole** GPL-3.0-or-later. It contains no nonfree component and no
FDK AAC.

The licence text of every statically linked component is in `licenses/ffmpeg/`,
collected from the actual source trees rather than transcribed. The component
inventory with versions, licences and source locations is in
`share/tesserafin/ffmpeg/sbom.cdx.json`; the source baseline is in
`share/tesserafin/ffmpeg/SOURCE.json`; the third-party notices are in
`share/tesserafin/ffmpeg/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.

The complete corresponding source is distributed **alongside** this archive, not
inside it. `FFMPEG-CORRESPONDING-SOURCE.txt` gives its exact filename and
SHA-256.

## The web client

Built from `https://github.com/tesserafin-project/tesserafin-web.git` at commit
`@WEB_VCS_REF@`. Its own third-party dependency licences are reproduced verbatim
under `share/tesserafin/web-licenses/` and are not restated here.
